\begin_layout Description
\begin_inset Formula $T_{3}(2)$
\end_inset

: 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "ans:T3of2"

\end_inset

Mulailah dengan menghitung 
\begin_inset Formula $\dddot{y}=\frac{d}{dt}\ddot{y}$
\end_inset

.
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\dddot{y} & = & \frac{d}{dt}\left(\frac{2y}{t^{2}}+t\right)\\
 & = & \frac{2\dot{y}t^{2}-4ty}{t^{4}}+1\\
 & = & \frac{2\left(-\frac{y}{t}+t^{2}\right)t^{2}-4ty}{t^{4}}+1\\
 & = & \frac{-2ty+2t^{4}-4ty}{t^{4}}+1\\
 & = & \frac{-6y}{t^{3}}+3
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

sehingga 
\begin_inset Formula $\dddot{y}(4)=\frac{-6(20)}{4^{3}}+3=3-\frac{120}{64}=\frac{9}{8}$
\end_inset

.
 Oleh karena itu, 
\begin_inset Formula $T_{3}(t)=20+11(t-4)+\frac{13}{4}(t-4)^{2}+\frac{3}{16}(t-4)^{3}$
\end_inset

, dan 
\begin_inset Formula $T_{3}(2)=9.5$
\end_inset

 sehingga nilainya dekat dengan 
\begin_inset Formula $T_{2}(2)=11$
\end_inset

.
 Kita mulai dapat menduga bahwa 
\begin_inset Formula $y(2)$
\end_inset

 kira-kira bernilai 
\begin_inset Formula $9.5$
\end_inset

 atau 
\begin_inset Formula $11$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

